Description: Wireless CarPlay receiver for rootless jailbreaks.
 Showcase turns a jailbroken iPhone or iPad into a wireless CarPlay
 receiver. This package uses the rootless layout under /var/jb and supports
 iOS 12 or newer.
 .
 KCS edition supports existing Wi-Fi networks and opt-in anonymous usage.
